OL,3,GNEWSAMy contraceptive coil saved my
OL,4,Alife after it revealed I had cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Caroline Bailey was suffering with
OL,7,Fsharp, stabbing pains in her stomach,
OL,8,Fshe thought it was being caused by her
OL,9,Fcontraceptive coil.
OL,11,FIn severe pain, the 54-year-old went to
OL,12,Fher GP, desperate to have it removed,
OL,13,Fonly for scans to reveal it was in fact
OL,14,Fa 13cm (5in) tumour pressing against
OL,15,Fher coil.
OL,17,FShe was diagnosed with stage three
OL,18,Fovarian cancer in June 2023 and feared
OL,19,Fshe might not live for another two
OL,20,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
