OL,3,GNEWSAMy contraceptive coil saved my
OL,4,Alife after it revealed I had cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow, with no evidence of disease after
OL,7,Fchemotherapy and surgery, she said: "I
OL,8,Fabsolutely think that the coil saved my
OL,9,Flife, which is mad."
